#. module: KSW_ext_sync
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:KSW_ext_sync.field_ksw_bas_customer__credit_term_days
msgid ""
"COD10.LIMT_DAYS — the payment term BAS itself assigns to this customer (e.g."
" 30/60/90). Matches this project's \"عمر الدين\" (debt age) column. Used by "
"KSW_commissions to decide how much of the outstanding balance counts as "
"overdue for the BAS-derived collection target. Falls back to 30 days when "
"unset/zero."
msgstr ""

